# Stage 2: the cave. Enemies appear on the right when the level reaches their
# progression (pixels of stage-2.png scrolled, 30 per second).
#
# The scrolling stops when the end of stage-2.png (3072 px wide) reaches the
# right edge of the screen (~427 px of background shown): 3072 - 427 = 2645.
# The Gomander, lying on the cave floor, comes then.
#
# The ceiling and the floor of the cave take about 37 and 65 world units: an
# enemy stays between y = 50 and 330 (y is its top), and one along a sine (40
# up and down) between 120 and 260. No random height here: it could reach the
# floor.
#
# Types: pata-pata (shoots, drops a life one time in ten), pow-armor (never
# shoots, always drops a Force item). loot (optional): life or force (always),
# life:<chance> or force:<chance> (0 to 1), or none.
length 2645
boss   gomander

# progression  type       y    movement  loot

# formation at 100, high
100            pata-pata  120  sine
130            pata-pata  120  sine
160            pata-pata  120  sine
